      "description": "The meme relies on the stereotype that Muslims are inherently violent or associated with terrorism, which is a common form of Islamophobia. The text 'they always blow up in your face' directly references the violent actions of some extremist groups, implicitly linking them to all Muslims, which is a harmful and inaccurate generalization.",
