      "label": "Terrorism Association",
      "description": "The image and text together imply that the group being referenced (likely Muslims, given the attire and context) is inherently linked to terrorism. This association is a real-world stereotype used to demonize and dehumanize a group, often used in hate speech and propaganda.",
