      "label": "Dehumanization Through Stereotyping",
      "description": "The meme dehumanizes the group by portraying them as inherently dangerous and unpredictable, using the image of armed militants to reinforce the stereotype that they are violent. This is a form of dehumanization that reduces a group to a single, negative trait.",
